Domain RecruitingAndStaffing
	documentation
" This domain defines the model for application and recruitment pursuers, events, and the opportunity they pursue of.
* A RecruitmentEvent entity is to capture information about the type, location and description of an event associated with the recruitment.
* A RecruitmentEventAttendance entity is for the details relating to the a prospect for employment or acceptance that has not made a formal application yet.
* An ApplicantProfile entity is to capture the details about the person making the application. These details consist of demographic, communicational and professional/academic information.
* An Application entity includes information about the pursue and pursuer of the employment and acceptance.
* An ApplicationEvent is to capture information about the lifecycle of the event associated with the pursue of employment or acceptance.
	domain entity RecruitmentEvent
	domain entity RecruitmentEventAttendance
	domain entity ApplicantProfile
	domain entity Application
	domain entity ApplicationEvent